  "registration": "repository-confirmatory-registration-v3",
  "sampleSizeRationale": "The frozen scanner-enriched corpus contains 24 repair tasks and eight negative controls from 28 public repositories. Each of the four requested model configurations receives every task across all three workflows, producing 384 assignments. The primary pooled estimand is an equal-weight average across exactly those configurations, with every configuration also reported separately. Repository-clustered resampling keeps all configurations paired within each task. The complete registered batch is reported without replacement or optional stopping. The study estimates effects only for these SiteCMD-detected cases and supports descriptive uncertainty, not a universal software-repair claim.",
  "analysis": {
    "population": "Public repositories in the frozen v3 scanner-enriched selection frame that meet the registered source, scanner, and offline behavioral qualification rules",
